{"schema_version":2,"train_id":"yuwen-mowen-train-62","wave_id":"yuwen-mowen-train-62-wave-01","stage":"private_quality_audit","status":"complete","source_artifact":{"workflow":"Release train orchestrator","run_id":30560674292,"artifact_id":8766746770,"artifact_name":"relation-audit-evidence","artifact_file":"yuwen_mowen.json","digest":"sha256:5ea8ccd1f0ca01987c4b4a73c24538b8b2056486532e8ea8f3058cf89b125cf0","head_sha":"c8154a64dc05227e058e2ff5a8fb338c31ad40ca"},"decisions":[{"packet_id":"yuwen-mowen-train62-packet-01","candidate":"_phase4_proofread/CANDIDATE_YUWEN_MOWEN_SCENES5581_5_5583_2_2026-07-31.json","scene_groups":["5581_5","5581_7","5581_8","5583_1","5583_2"],"status":"audited","fixes":[{"key":"5581_7_Dlgs_Index1_Text","before":"1 - 宇文逸 $@$ああ、行こう。","after":"1 - 宇文逸 $@$はい、行きましょう。","reason":"relation/voice: 大師兄の『師弟、行こう』へ応じる同門平時の短句。宇文逸は莫問へ師兄呼称と自然な敬体を保つ時期で、同型の既存場面でも『行きましょう』を用いる。現訳の常体は二分岐だけ関係距離を不自然に縮めるため戻す。"},{"key":"5581_8_Dlgs_Index1_Text","before":"1 - 宇文逸 $@$ああ、行こう。","after":"1 - 宇文逸 $@$はい、行きましょう。","reason":"relation/voice: 5581_7と復命先だけが異なる並行分岐。同じ大師兄への応答であり、片方だけでなく両分岐とも師兄への自然な敬体を保つ。"},{"key":"5583_1_Dlgs_Index1_Text","before":"5003 - 清虚道長 $@$ふふ、堅苦しい挨拶は無用だ……この旅はご苦労だった。","after":"5003 - 清虚道長 $@$ふふ、堅苦しい挨拶は無用じゃ……この旅はご苦労であった。","reason":"voice: 帰還した弟子を鎮めて労う清虚の師モード。現訳の現代的な『無用だ／ご苦労だった』は、直後の古風な訓導と声が断絶するため、意味を変えず慈愛ある古風体へ戻す。"},{"key":"5583_1_Dlgs_Index3_Text","before":"5003 - 清虚道長 $@$まさか、そなたらが一挙に天龍幇の企みを挫き、峋谷関の包囲まで解くとはな。まこと、後生は畏るべきものじゃ！","after":"5003 - 清虚道長 $@$まさか、そなたらが一挙に天龍幇の企みを挫き、峋谷関の包囲まで解くとはな。まこと、後生畏るべしとはこのことじゃ！","reason":"allusion/voice: 『后生可畏』は『論語』子罕に由来し、日本語でも『後生畏るべし』として定着する。現訳は意味説明へ崩しているため、清虚の古風な称賛として定着した読み下しを会話に収める。"}],"keeps":["5581_5_Dlgs_Index0_Text","5581_5_Dlgs_Index1_Text","5581_5_Dlgs_Index2_Text","5581_5_Dlgs_Index3_Text","5581_5_Dlgs_Index4_Text","5581_5_Dlgs_Index5_Text","5581_5_Dlgs_Index6_Text","5581_5_Dlgs_Index7_Text","5581_5_Dlgs_Index8_Text","5581_5_Dlgs_Index9_Text","5581_5_Dlgs_Index10_Text","5581_7_Dlgs_Index0_Text","5581_8_Dlgs_Index0_Text","5583_1_Dlgs_Index0_Text","5583_1_Dlgs_Index2_Text","5583_1_Dlgs_Index4_Text","5583_1_Dlgs_Index5_Text","5583_1_Dlgs_Index6_Text","5583_1_Dlgs_Index7_Text","5583_1_Dlgs_Index8_Text","5583_1_Dlgs_Index9_Text","5583_1_Dlgs_Index10_Text","5583_1_Dlgs_Index11_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index0_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index1_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index2_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index3_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index4_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index5_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index7_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index8_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index9_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index10_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index11_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index12_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index13_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index14_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index15_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index16_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index17_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index18_Text"],"allusion_review_candidates":["后生可畏","大是大非","舟车劳顿"],"allusion_review_resolved":[{"key":"5583_1_Dlgs_Index3_Text","decision":"特定典籍由来の定着成語","note":"『后生可畏』は『論語』子罕に由来し、日本語の定着した読み下し『後生畏るべし』を優先する。朗誦ではなく若い弟子への称賛として機能するため、修正訳では『とはこのことじゃ』で会話へ接続する。"},{"key":"5583_1_Dlgs_Index6_Text","decision":"定着した価値判断表現","note":"『大是大非』は根本的な是非・大義に関わる判断を指す定着表現。特定典籍の引用ではなく師の評価として機能し、現訳『こうした大義に関わることでは』が文脈と重みを保つ。"},{"key":"5583_2_Dlgs_Index12_Text","decision":"定着した旅疲れ表現","note":"『舟车劳顿』は長旅の疲労を表す定着表現。現訳『この道中、旅の疲れもあるじゃろう』は、休息を勧める清虚の生活上の気遣いとして自然に機能する。"}],"fact_doubts":[{"scope":"yaoji_departure_and_reunion","keys":["5581_5_Dlgs_Index1_Text","5581_5_Dlgs_Index3_Text","5581_5_Dlgs_Index9_Text","5581_5_Dlgs_Index10_Text"],"note":"義父への復命は瑶姫本人の理由。再会が早い可能性も軽口と予測に留まり、具体的な予定・任務・再会時期を確定しない。"},{"scope":"report_destination_branch_variants","keys":["5581_7_Dlgs_Index0_Text","5581_7_Dlgs_Index1_Text","5581_8_Dlgs_Index0_Text","5581_8_Dlgs_Index1_Text"],"note":"5581_7は清霄師伯、5581_8は師父へ復命する並行分岐。復命先と経路を直列合成せず、訳文修正は共通する宇文逸の応答registerだけに限定する。"},{"scope":"qingxu_concealment_and_liaocheng_truth","keys":["5583_1_Dlgs_Index7_Text","5583_1_Dlgs_Index9_Text","5583_1_Dlgs_Index11_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index0_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index2_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index3_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index4_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index5_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index7_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index8_Text"],"note":"清虚が真相を伏せた理由は、当時の情勢不明と宇文逸が性急に復讐へ走る危険を避けるためという本人の説明。叔父の死因、襲撃の具体像、清虚が知った時期・経路は補完しない。"},{"scope":"scheduled_assault_before_emergency_change","keys":["5583_2_Dlgs_Index10_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index11_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index12_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index13_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index15_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index16_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index17_Text","5583_2_Dlgs_Index18_Text"],"note":"この場面では各派は翌日の総攻撃を予定し、清虚は会議へ向かい弟子らへ休息を命じる。次場面5585_4の攻撃前倒しを遡及して混入させない。"}],"reading_attestation":{"contract_id":"quality-audit-source-feedback-v1","manifest_digest":"sha256:d9cc7e22ed777d10ad4a1ab66e395331caa908d505142a277fb3fcd4f8afb0c6","primary_evidence_reviewed":true,"doubt_gates_completed_before_reference_crosscheck":true,"documents":[{"path":".agents/skills/zhja-game-translation-codex/SKILL.md","digest":"sha256:46ad6f5075579dd27ac4839147853798da3b95f4f094f9bb30d7c79f940852cd","status":"reviewed"},{"path":".agents/skills/zhja-game-translation-codex/references/03_style_guide.md","digest":"sha256:3d2a2a1ebdceb2b45c4f31d25abe1daffbb4eab544fb7e6b4c3cbc9de03604de","status":"reviewed"},{"path":".agents/skills/zhja-game-translation-codex/references/04_persona.md","digest":"sha256:77aea1ef8798cf537fc03e03e5ab32749f1edfb747c6caee68adec6acaab1e45","status":"reviewed"},{"path":".agents/skills/zhja-game-translation-codex/references/05_terminology.md","digest":"sha256:50ec5fcaa928bb62fc82d2c9ef4e0a20ae32585bef5bc4edf79a28c88e50e900","status":"reviewed"},{"path":".agents/skills/zhja-game-translation-codex/references/06_qa.md","digest":"sha256:87ec74a6401d10a6b4c85c8230d9cdc1ef8bff326d93f8b86f9d4e8cb0d188d6","status":"reviewed"},{"path":".agents/skills/zhja-game-translation-codex/references/08_pair_reaudit.md","digest":"sha256:a1b993d29e34efe753d13cce59796056b521971871f7f6612a5b0465992b8917","status":"reviewed"},{"path":".agents/skills/zhja-game-translation-codex/references/10_register_axes.md","digest":"sha256:3d4e6261474aea14539876fcb1d17a88a